@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape report
+
+* `analyzeLandscape` creates or refreshes a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the `index.html` report next to it), aggregating the repository analyses found under the analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name, kept so existing scripts keep working. Both accept the same options (`-analysisRoot`, `-recursive`, `-confFile`, `-setName`, `-setDescription`, `-setLogoLink`, `-addLink`, `-date`, `-timeout`).
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
 ### Docker
 
